  "title": "United Bank Welcomes Jonathan Schnell as VP, Senior Fiduciary Wealth Advisor",
  "summary": "MORGANTOWN, WV – United Bank recently welcomed Jonathan Schnell as Vice President, Senior Fiduciary Wealth Advisor for its Wealth Management division. In this role, Schnell will manage client relationships across the Morgantown Market and surrounding areas, providing expert guidance on investment strategies, asset allocation, and advanced estate planning for high-net-worth clients.",
